      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065007300650020006C006F006F006B0020006C0069006B0065002000660069006C006500730020006F006E00200061006C006C002000740068006500200063006100730065007300200045006D006D006120190073000A0077006F0072006B0069006E00670020006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The sink is pretty clean. It must not be used very\noften.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065002000730069006E006B002000690073002000700072006500740074007900200063006C00650061006E002E0020004900740020006D0075007300740020006E006F00740020006200650020007500730065006400200076006500720079000A006F006600740065006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a picture of Mimi with a man wearing a suit.\nThey seem to be having fun.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a picture of Mimi with a man wearing\ndistinctive goggles. They seem happy.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you want to keep winning in the Z-A Royale, pay\nattention to your position on the battlefield.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve received reports about Rogue Mega-Evolved\nPokémon, but I know Team MZ is on the case!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s ask around to see if anyone has any\ninformation about Gwynn’s whereabouts.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m glad we were able to locate Gwynn. Another\ncase closed!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200067006C0061006400200077006500200077006500720065002000610062006C006500200074006F0020006C006F00630061007400650020004700770079006E006E002E00200041006E006F0074006800650072000A006300610073006500200063006C006F007300650064002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That L person... He always seems to show up with\nZygarde. But why?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100740020004C00200070006500720073006F006E002E002E002E00200048006500200061006C00770061007900730020007300650065006D007300200074006F002000730068006F007700200075007000200077006900740068000A005A007900670061007200640065002E00200042007500740020007700680079003F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see you’re making your way up the ranks of the\nZ-A Royale pretty smoothly.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you using Mega Evolution? It’s useful when\ndealing with Rogue Mega-Evolved Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBesides, Trainers need to be Mega Evolving their\nPokémon for the strongest Mega Evolution user<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto emerge, as AZ wishes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 218
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve chased down endless leads, but I still can’t\nfigure out what exactly L is trying to achieve.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nHonestly, it’s making me doubt myself.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whatever is going on with Prism Tower, I’ll\nprotect the peace of Lumiose. That’s the promise<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI made to Mr. Looker.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There are plenty of people and Pokémon who\nneed help here in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065002000610072006500200070006C0065006E007400790020006F0066002000700065006F0070006C006500200061006E006400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000770068006F000A006E006500650064002000680065006C00700020006800650072006500200069006E0020004C0075006D0069006F00730065002100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
